# Published workstation images built by this repository.
#
# Format: <name> <version> <manifest-list digest>. Comments and blank lines are
# ignored. A line with a version but no digest means "this version exists in the
# release workflow but has never been published", which the resolver refuses to
# turn into a floating reference.
#
# These are the *only* values a deployment should reference. `compose.yml` can
# build the same images locally for development, but a released deployment must
# pull by digest so a moved tag cannot change what runs.
#
# The release workflow writes this file. Do not hand-edit a digest: record what
# `docker buildx imagetools inspect` reports for the published manifest list.
#
# Resolve a digest for a new version with:
#   docker buildx imagetools inspect \
#     ghcr.io/sagehou/dsh-workstation-runtime:0.2.1 --format '{{json .Manifest.Digest}}'
runtime 0.2.4 sha256:bf6afaaa902aa32a9f5752be31fc3896443516e0caeeb27d4f4362d4190fa7f4
gateway 0.1.2 sha256:8252663316443e1407ae52b5d5f4e28d7c536d9a434fb901b53207baa2444941
